OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers 'hacked off' over
OL,4,Arepeated developments
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of residents say they are
OL,7,Frepeatedly having to fight plans for
OL,8,Flarge-scale projects in what they call
OL,9,Fthe most overdeveloped village in their
OL,10,Farea, with a concrete processing plant
OL,11,Fat one end and a large underground
OL,12,Fcovered reservoir at the other.
OL,14,FPeople in Springwell Village near
OL,15,FSunderland said they had to deal with
OL,16,Fexcessive dust and noise from approved
OL,17,Fdevelopments.
OL,19,FThose living opposite Springwell Quarry
OL,20,Fsaid they also feared pollutants in the
OL,21,Fdust after the demolished Gateshead
OL,22,Fflyover was processed there.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
