OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers 'hacked off' over
OL,4,Arepeated developments
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Ashcourt Group, which runs the
OL,7,Fquarry, said it "monitors dust levels
OL,8,Fin accordance with the planning
OL,9,Fconditions" and results show it was
OL,10,Fcompliant.
